// The Gorge: two plateaus and a ravine between them, stepped so anyone can climb out.
//  - Three plank bridges cross it, with rope rails: fire runs along the rope and eats the bridge,
//    and what is left in the middle falls on whoever is in the ravine under it.
//  - Two boulders hang over the ravine from beams on stone posts, either side of the middle
//    bridge: burn the rope (or the beam) to drop one.
//  - Stone outcrops on the plateaus for cover; volt breaks stone four times as fast.
